	<entry>
		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Problème de ORDER BY sur un champ de type case when]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=20297#p20297"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Bonjour,</p><br /><p>J&#039;ai remarqué qu&#039;il n&#039;était pas possible de faire un &quot;ORDER BY CASE WHEN mon_champ&quot; lorsque &quot;mon_champ&quot; est le résultat d&#039;un CASE WHEN.</p><p>Exemple :</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code>SELECT
    case when champ1 in (&#039;toto&#039;, &#039;titi&#039;, &#039;tutu&#039;) then champ1 else &#039;tata&#039; end as alias1,
    champ2,
    -- Champs agrégats (SUM, COUNT etc)
FROM tables
GROUP BY 
    case when champ1 in (&#039;toto&#039;, &#039;titi&#039;, &#039;tutu&#039;) then champ1 else &#039;tata&#039; end, 
    champ2
ORDER BY case alias1 when &#039;tutu&#039; then 1 when &#039;titi&#039; then 2 when &#039;tutu&#039; then 3 else 4 end, champ2</code></pre></div><p>Est-ce que c&#039;est normal ?</p><br /><p>Cordialement,</p>]]></content>
